# i18n Full Coverage Execution Changes Log — 100% App Localization

Autonomous sweep following the TDD loop. Builds on the i18n infrastructure sprint
(`AppLanguage`, `LanguageController`, `AppStrings`, `LocalizationScope`,
`LanguageSwitcher`) and removes every remaining hardcoded UI literal. All work
committed to `main`; verification used the pinned FVM SDK (Flutter 3.29.0).

## Task 1: Audit & Expand Dictionaries
- `lib/core/domain/i18n/app_strings.dart` — contract expanded from ~35 to ~120
  typed members, grouped by surface (routines, schedule, nutrition dashboard,
  workout completion, food/stomach sheet, exercise detail, routine summary,
  weekly stats, history dialog/editor, daily log, AI chat, profile form,
  main shell). Added parameterized formatters (`caloriesOfTarget`,
  `macroOfTarget`, `setsAndReps`, `setsRepsLoad`, `macroSummary`, `itemCount`,
  `kcal`, `kcalAmount`, `setsOfPlanned`, `setsProgress`, `volumeOfPlanned`,
  `completedOfPlanned`, `signedKcal`, `recoveryLabel`, `regionLabel`,
  `requiredField`, `minimumOneMessage`, `fitnessGoal`, `monthYear`,
  `weekdayNarrow`, `weekdayShort`, `agendaTitle`, `editEntryTitleFor`,
  `deleteRecordConfirm`, `savedSummary`) plus the new `BodyRegion` enum.
- `lib/core/domain/i18n/english_strings.dart` & `spanish_strings.dart` — full
  implementations; `RecoveryLevel` / `FitnessGoal` reuse the existing domain
  enums (`core/domain/popups/exercise_completion.dart`,
  `core/models/user_profile.dart`).

## Task 2: Replace Hardcoded Strings in UI Components
Localized in place (all via `LocalizationScope.stringsOf(context)`):
- Pages: `routines_page.dart` (title, Body Projection, workout toggle),
  `nutrition_page.dart` (title, calorie summary, reactive-notification toggle,
  EXERCISE NOT / Test Notifications, Protein/Carbs/Fat rings, Weekly Calories,
  quick-add title, log-a-meal fields + button), `schedule_page.dart` (title,
  month/agenda labels, weekday headers, empty agenda),
  `profile_page.dart` (all field labels, goal dropdown, save button, every
  validation message), `main_shell_page.dart` (app title, Weekly Stats/History
  tooltips, Daily Log FAB).
- Sheets/dialogs: `quick_add_grams_dialog.dart`, `body_food_detail_sheet.dart`
  (title, captions, macro/calorie totals, item count, delete tooltip),
  `body_exercise_detail_sheet.dart` (empty states, sets progress, volume,
  AI suggestion), `exercise_completion_sheet.dart` (title, sets/reps, burned
  calories, recovery chips, done), `routine_summary_sheet.dart` (title, caption,
  empty state, region labels via `regionForSegment`, totals),
  `weekly_stats_sheet.dart` (header, caption, consumed/burned/balance tiles),
  `calendar_history_dialog.dart` (history title, month label, weekday header,
  editor title, macro fields, delete/save), `daily_log_sheet.dart` (title,
  subtitle, hint, cancel/analyzing/save, saved snackbar),
  `ai_chat_sheet.dart` (title, empty prompt, hint, close/send, availability
  error), `offline_ai_dialog.dart`.
- Removed the redundant `LanguageSectionHeading` from `language_switcher.dart`.
- Intentionally left untranslated: the brand name `NutriExercise` and physical
  unit suffixes (`kg`, `cm`, `g`), which are not language-specific words.

## Task 3: Comprehensive Language Switcher Test
- `test/i18n/full_coverage_test.dart` — an `_AllStringsProbe` widget renders a
  representative value for **every** `AppStrings` getter; unit tests assert no
  blank keys in either language and that English/Spanish differ on core labels;
  widget tests pump the probe in each language.
- `test/features/i18n_full_coverage_widget_test.dart` — live `LanguageController`
  switch tests asserting the Nutrition, Routines and Profile tabs (including form
  validation messages) fully re-render in Spanish.

